          "It <b>didn't rain</b>."
        ],
        [
          "Tom <b>had</b> a dog.",
          "Tom <b>didn't have</b> a dog."
        ]
      ],
      "note": "Fíjate: el pasado <b>salta</b> del verbo a <b>didn't</b>. played → didn't play, went → didn't go. ¡Solo un pasado por frase!",
      "note_en": "The past moves from the verb to didn't. Only one past per sentence!"
    },
    {
      "t": "rule",
      "title": "2 · Preguntas",
      "title_en": "Questions",
      "icon": "❓",
      "color": "blue",
      "es": "Para preguntar, ponemos <b>Did</b> al principio, luego el <b>sujeto</b> y después el verbo en <b>forma base</b>. Sin did, la pregunta no funciona: <s>You went to the park?</s> → <b>Did</b> you <b>go</b> to the park?",
      "en": "<b>Did</b> + subject + base verb…? Don't forget did!",
      "formula": [
        "*Did* + sujeto + *verbo base* + …?"
      ],
      "examples": [
        {
          "en": "<b>Did</b> you <b>like</b> the film?",
