      "en": "I can ask questions with Did."
    },
    {
      "es": "Contesto con respuestas cortas: Yes, I did. / No, she didn't.",
      "en": "I can give short answers."
    },
    {
      "es": "Pregunto con <b>Where / What / When… + did</b>.",
      "en": "I can ask Wh- questions with did."
    },
    {
      "es": "Nunca escribo <s>didn't went</s> ni <s>Did you saw</s>.",
      "en": "I never write didn't went or Did you saw."
